\begin_inset Formula $\left|\alpha\right|\leq n$
\end_inset

.
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

אז עבור 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha$
\end_inset

 עם 
\begin_inset Formula $\left|\alpha\right|=n+1$
\end_inset

